# Keeps the Docker build context off the multi-gigabyte working tree; it has to
# be committed to take effect for anyone else, so exempt it from the .* rule.
!.dockerignore
# Pins patch files to LF so Windows checkouts don't corrupt them via autocrlf;
# has to be committed to take effect for anyone else, so exempt it too.
!.gitattributes
autogen_*.html
